    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>clearly some sort of cloth (since imported in pieces), presumably with embroidered pellicans as a decorative or heraldic device (MED s.v. pellican(e n. b)) | clearly some sort of cloth (since imported in pieces), presumably with embroidered pellicans as a decorative or heraldic device (MED s.v. pellican(e n. b), here of low quality) | some sort of cloth (since measured in pieces) decorated with images of pellicans (see also banker)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
